{"4423580": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Shadow Dungeon", "steam_appid": 4423580, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >《Shadow Dungeon》 is a dark fantasy action RPG featuring a retro-inspired visual style reminiscent of late 1990s role-playing games. Choose your hero and embark on an epic journey through a vast and mysterious world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From eerie and terrifying dungeons to solemn ancient temples, from scorching deserts to haunted ruins filled with restless spirits, and even to places no mortal has ever set foot in — including distant realms beyond reality and the depths of hell itself. The world is filled with hidden treasures waiting to be discovered. Every ruin conceals secrets, every strange artifact holds ancient power, and countless legendary creatures lurk in the darkness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Terrifying monsters, demonic beings, undead warriors, cyclopes, mysterious cultists, evil spirits, zombies, and many other malicious entities will stop at nothing to block your path.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Diverse Character Classes:</strong>  </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game offers 4 unique classes, 12 distinct talent trees, and hundreds of skills. Master elemental magic as a sorcerer, wield dual blades as a holy warrior, strike with deadly precision as an archer, or summon demons and skeletons as a necromancer. Endless combinations await your exploration.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4423580/extras/987a31532d6ac6ff8407bbf3fe064b38.poster.avif?t=1787744876\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4423580/extras/987a31532d6ac6ff8407bbf3fe064b38.webm?t=1787744876\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4423580/extras/987a31532d6ac6ff8407bbf3fe064b38.mp4?t=1787744876\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Massive Arsenal of Equipment:</strong>  </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game features over 100,000,000 pieces of equipment. Carefully crafted legendary and mythic items make up more than half of all loot. By combining different weapons and skills, you can create your own hybrid builds and discover your preferred playstyle. Every piece of loot has value, and every class offers countless optimal equipment choices. Through experimentation and customization, forge your own unique combat style and carve a bloody path through the underworld.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4423580/extras/0b9c3e689951aae2d87a0131eb46abbf.poster.avif?t=1787744876\" width=500 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4423580/extras/0b9c3e689951aae2d87a0131eb46abbf.webm?t=1787744876\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Challenging Combat Experience:</strong>  </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With diverse environments, massive hordes of uniquely designed enemies, deep character progression systems, and intense real-time combat, the game delivers constant excitement. As your journey progresses, you will unlock powerful abilities, wield epic weapons, gain various buffs, and face increasingly dangerous challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4423580/extras/62a049860f74384bded7e3546ae373ea.poster.avif?t=1787744876\" width=600 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4423580/extras/62a049860f74384bded7e3546ae373ea.webm?t=1787744876\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4423580/extras/62a049860f74384bded7e3546ae373ea.mp4?t=1787744876\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Immersive Musical Experience:</strong>  </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A rich original soundtrack blending gothic atmospheres with late-90s orchestral elements creates an epic retro gaming experience. Powerful theme music draws you deep into the unique world of Shadow Dungeon.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Revolutionary Sound Design Technology:</strong>  </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Advanced audio algorithms, multi-layered sound avoidance systems, intelligent loudness control, and dozens of post-processing tracks ensure perfect integration of skill effects, monster sounds, background music, and ambient audio, delivering an immersive auditory experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4423580/extras/76e3a10320aff6aea947e6450743f8d3.poster.avif?t=1787744876\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4423580/extras/76e3a10320aff6aea947e6450743f8d3.webm?t=1787744876\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4423580/extras/76e3a10320aff6aea947e6450743f8d3.mp4?t=1787744876\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Extreme Performance Optimization:</strong>  </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Specialized optimizations handle large numbers of enemies, spells, and sound effects on screen. Even during intense battles filled with explosions, fire, and lightning, the game maintains smooth and responsive gameplay.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Retro Dark Gothic Art Style:</strong>  </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Travel back in time to the golden age of classic dark loot-driven RPGs around the year 2000 and experience their timeless charm.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4423580/extras/b0e270cc177fa84d6bd01de1b43bae80.poster.avif?t=1787744876\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4423580/extras/b0e270cc177fa84d6bd01de1b43bae80.webm?t=1787744876\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4423580/extras/b0e270cc177fa84d6bd01de1b43bae80.mp4?t=1787744876\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Deeply Immersive Gameplay:</strong>  </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Featuring complex talent systems, balanced statistics, visually striking yet restrained skill effects, randomized loot, and immersive audio, the game delivers a deeply engaging experience.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pure Loot-Driven Gameplay:</strong>  </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No seasonal resets. All epic items you obtain will remain permanently and never be weakened. No microtransactions. All loot is earned through combat. A truly pure experience designed to be enjoyed for years to come.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4423580/extras/340c4c86b9fa2f28e24ab969ec8f9648.poster.avif?t=1787744876\" width=582 height=306 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4423580/extras/340c4c86b9fa2f28e24ab969ec8f9648.webm?t=1787744876\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4423580/extras/340c4c86b9fa2f28e24ab969ec8f9648.mp4?t=1787744876\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Complete Content List:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >7 Chapters with over 160 unique maps and stages</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4 Playable Characters, 12 Talent Trees, and more than 370 Skills, allowing countless creative builds</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 100,000,000 Different Items generated semi-randomly from 3,200 base templates. More than half of all equipment includes additional skills that synergize with talents</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >15 Unique Armor Sets for Every Class</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlimited Skill Points, enabling advanced hybrid builds in late-game progression</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 60 Unique Bosses and more than 200 Distinct Monsters, each with unique mechanics and attack patterns</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >17 Blessing Shrines, various gems, buff potions, and rare permanent elixirs to empower your journey</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Massive Inventory System:  Unlock additional pages through quests and carry thousands of items. A gigantic storage warehouse with unlimited pages allows you to store hundreds of thousands of items and fully enjoy the thrill of collecting legendary gear</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mystic Dungeon Challenges</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reforging, Enchanting &amp; Enhancement System</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4423580/extras/4de2454d1a3ef41aef1802a7a4cfae03.poster.avif?t=1787744876\" width=582 height=306 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4423580/extras/4de2454d1a3ef41aef1802a7a4cfae03.webm?t=1787744876\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4423580/extras/4de2454d1a3ef41aef1802a7a4cfae03.mp4?t=1787744876\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Planned Future Content:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4 New Classes (Assassin, Engineer, Barbarian, Warlock)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mercenary System</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tower Defense Challenges</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rune System</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Transmutation &amp; Crafting System</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >《Shadow Dungeon》 is a dark fantasy action RPG featuring a retro-inspired visual style reminiscent of late 1990s role-playing games. Choose your hero and embark on an epic journey through a vast and mysterious world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From eerie and terrifying dungeons to solemn ancient temples, from scorching deserts to haunted ruins filled with restless spirits, and even to places no mortal has ever set foot in — including distant realms beyond realit